      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "During the Civil War, Union and Confederate forces camped near Nokesville, including Hooker's division meeting Jackson's rear guard at Kettle Run.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
